## 6. Try It Yourself

Clone the repository and build the C interaction-net core (requires only `gcc`/`clang` and `make`):

```
git clone https://github.com/avikj/hyperactivity.git
cd hyperactivity
make
```

Inspect any definition in the content-addressed store, or typecheck your own `.cub` file:

```
./hyperactive def ua
./hyperactive def s-front
build/cubical my-file.cub
```

